===Etymology===
{{compound|en|golden|eye}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈɡəʊldn̩.ɑɪ/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of several [[seaduck]]s, of the [[genus]] ''[[Bucephala]]'', having black and white [[plumage]].
# Any of several [[lacewing]]s of the [[family]] [[Chrysopidae]].
# Any of several flowering plants of the [[subtribe]] {{taxlink|Helianthinae|subtribe}}.

====Synonyms====
